==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*obzorъ}}. {{surf|+deverbal|ru|обозре́ть}}, with typical Indo-European nominal ''o''-vocalism (compare {{m|ru|набо́р}} and {{m|ru|набра́ть}}, the latter with future tense {{m|ru|наберу́}} etc. showing typical Indo-European present/future verbal ''e''-vocalism).

